  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)<br><strong>Type:</strong> Cybereye<br><strong>Install:</strong> Clinic<br><strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 3 (1d6)<br><strong>Option Slots:</strong> uses 1</p>\n<p>Cybereye Option. The user can make out detail up to 100m/yds away. Attacking a target 13-50m/yds away with a Single Shot or Aimed Shot gives +1 to the attack check. Multiple installations don't stack, and it doesn't stack with the Long Scope attachment.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>The +1 is situational because it only applies at 13-50m/yds: tick it in the roll dialog.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberoptics).</em></p>"
